A donation from your Donor Advised Fund (DAF) can help sustain information for the long-term while providing tax benefits to you.&nbsp;

You can make a donation from your DAF by selecting “NEO Philanthropy” as your charity (EIN 13-3191113), and in the memo, note or “in honor of” please add “Plan C.”&nbsp;

You are always welcome to give us a heads up so we can track your gift: email {% inlineLink action={discriminant: "mailto", value: "donations@plancpills.org"} _language="" %}donations@plancpills.org{% /inlineLink %}.
